    "updated_at": "2025-01-07T19:15:24Z",
    "body": "> Thinking of use cases, the font relative metrics seem like they could and should always resolve against whatever font is being used for text operations. I feel authors would expect that and it seems implementable.\r\n\r\nWe should make sure to specify what the root-font-relative units (rem, etc.) should do explicitly as well (perhaps they just alias the non-root ones)?",
